{
    "title": "Daily Bubble",
    "description": "\"Daily Bubble\" is an addictive relaxing number bubble merge puzzle game. \ud83e\udde9 Connect same numbered bubbles to merge them! Make the longest chains and merge them to get more points!\ud83c\udfc6 Challenge your mind and solve the puzzles, and then you will find them easy and exciting!\r\n\r\nHow to play?\r\n \u2043 Slide the same numbers in any of the eight directions (up, down, left, right or diagonally) to merge them.\r\n \u2043 The same bubbles will be merged to a larger number bubble.\r\n \u2043 No Time Limited!\r\n \u2043 Just Slide!\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n \u2043 Beautifully easy and simple, no pressure and no time limit.\r\n \u2043 Challenging to break your highest score.\r\n \u2043 Easy to play. Classic merge and number game for all ages!\r\n \u2043 Multiple beautiful background pictures.\r\n \u2043 Multiple materials of bubbles. Such as: iron, crystal, wood\u2026\r\n\r\nCome to play this game and become a master of Number Bubble Game now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "&quot;Daily Bubble&quot; is an addictive relaxing number bubble merge puzzle game. \ud83e\udde9 Connect same numbered bubbles to merge them! Make the longest chains and merge them to get more points!\ud83c\udfc6 Challenge your mind and solve the puzzles, and then you will find them easy and exciting!<br><br>How to play?<br> \u2043 Slide the same numbers in any of the eight directions (up, down, left, right or diagonally) to merge them.<br> \u2043 The same bubbles will be merged to a larger number bubble.<br> \u2043 No Time Limited!<br> \u2043 Just Slide!<br><br>Features:<br> \u2043 Beautifully easy and simple, no pressure and no time limit.<br> \u2043 Challenging to break your highest score.<br> \u2043 Easy to play. Classic merge and number game for all ages!<br> \u2043 Multiple beautiful background pictures.<br> \u2043 Multiple materials of bubbles. Such as: iron, crystal, wood\u2026<br><br>Come to play this game and become a master of Number Bubble Game now!",
